Case 1: 3 lines cannot make exactly 4 crossings.
Case 2: 8 lines cannot make exactly 11 crossings.
Case 3: 12 lines cannot make exactly 68 crossings.
Case 4: 6 lines with exactly 8 crossings can cut the plane into 15 pieces at most.
Case 5: 8 lines with exactly 27 crossings can cut the plane into 36 pieces at most.
Case 6: 11 lines with exactly 32 crossings can cut the plane into 44 pieces at most.
Case 7: 12 lines with exactly 51 crossings can cut the plane into 64 pieces at most.
